  "status": "stable",
  "added": "2026-04-19",
  "notes": "Declares membership of a Concept in a ConceptScheme. A Concept may belong to multiple schemes — repeat for each. `skos:topConceptOf` is a subproperty of `inScheme`, so a top concept is automatically a member of the scheme. Upstream SKOS declares no domain for `inScheme` (only range ConceptScheme).",
  "examples": [
